Package: bagelR
Type: Package
Title: Fast Bayesian Online Changepoint Detection Algorithm
Version: 1.8.2
Date: 2026-11-05
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Grose", email = "dan.grose@lancaster.ac.uk", role = "aut"),
    person("Ziyang", "Yang", email = "zoey.ziyang.yang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Paul", "Fearnhead", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Ziyang Yang <zoey.ziyang.yang@outlook.com>
Description: Bayesian online changepoint detection for linear models via
    posterior merging. We analyse univariate time series with changes in mean,
    slope, or regression coefficients, with known or unknown observation
    variance and optional common structure such as seasonal effects. The
    method is described by Yang, Fearnhead, and Grose (2026)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2611.03230>.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/grosed/bagel
BugReports: https://github.com/grosed/bagel/issues
